  {
   "id": "ex8",
   "stem": [
    {
     "k": "p",
     "t": {
      "en": "Let $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} -1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 3 \\end{array}\\right]$. Find all $2\\times 2$-matrices $B$ such that $AB=0$.",
      "sha": "1841207c6d4f",
      "zh": "设 $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} -1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 3 \\end{array}\\right]$。求所有满足 $AB=0$ 的 $2\\times 2$ 矩阵 $B$。"
     }
    }
   ],
   "sol": [
    {
     "k": "p",
     "t": {
      "en": "$\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} -1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 3 \\end{array}\\right] \\left[\\begin{array}{cc} x & y \\\\ z & w \\end{array}\\right] = \\left[\\begin{array}{cc} -x-z & -w-y \\\\ 3x+3z & 3w+3y \\end{array}\\right] = \\left[\\begin{array}{cc} 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 \\end{array}\\right]$. Solution is: $w=-y$, $x=-z$. So the matrices are of the form $\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} x & y \\\\ -x & -y \\end{array}\\right]$.",
      "sha": "01af4c0f1675",
      "zh": "$\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} -1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 3 \\end{array}\\right] \\left[\\begin{array}{cc} x & y \\\\ z & w \\end{array}\\right] = \\left[\\begin{array}{cc} -x-z & -w-y \\\\ 3x+3z & 3w+3y \\end{array}\\right] = \\left[\\begin{array}{cc} 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 \\end{array}\\right]$。解为：$w=-y$，$x=-z$。所以这样的矩阵形如 $\\left[\\begin{array}{rr} x & y \\\\ -x & -y \\end{array}\\right]$。"
     }
    }
   ],
   "source_refs": [
